+   *
+   * Input:
+   *      - ISAC_main_inst    : ISAC instance.
+   *      - encoded           : encoded ISAC frame(s).
+   *      - packet_size       : size of the packet in bytes.
+   *      - rtp_seq_number    : the RTP number of the packet.
+   *      - send_ts           : the send time of the packet from RTP header,
